(6474164, 962512, 15711, '<td valign="top">I usually find these fire/candle shots boring, but somehow, this captivates me.  I love the mix of orange/yellow and blue.  Great use of complimentary colors. 7</td>', 'I usually find these fire/candle shots boring, but somehow, this captivates me.  I love the mix of orange/yellow and blue.  Great use of complimentary colors. 7', '2011-07-18 11:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
