(6474170, 962590, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is fabulous.  I love that you centered the cow.  If I could nitpick one thing, I might''ve whitened the face and legs of a cow a smidge more by doing seslective color or possibly dodge(to get rid of some of the pink).  I still love it.  Cows.... you just can''t go wrong. :) 7</td>', 'This is fabulous.  I love that you centered the cow.  If I could nitpick one thing, I might''ve whitened the face and legs of a cow a smidge more by doing seslective color or possibly dodge(to get rid of some of the pink).  I still love it.  Cows.... you just can''t go wrong. :) 7', '2011-07-18 11:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
