(6474206, 962593, 15711, '<td valign="top">GOOD LORD that''s a terrific portrait.  To hell with the background.  I''d have cropped him so he almost filled the frame.  Perfect exposure and focus. 9</td>', 'GOOD LORD that''s a terrific portrait.  To hell with the background.  I''d have cropped him so he almost filled the frame.  Perfect exposure and focus. 9', '2011-07-18 11:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
