(6477124, 962624, 63244, '<td valign="top">How many ND filters would it take to make someone you really didn''t like disappear? Nevermind... :P<br/>I like this shot and the water smoothness is excellent. On my monitor, there appears to be a bit of a pink tint to the photograph.</td>', 'How many ND filters would it take to make someone you really didn''t like disappear? Nevermind... :PI like this shot and the water smoothness is excellent. On my monitor, there appears to be a bit of a pink tint to the photograph.', '2011-07-20 17:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
