(6479388, 962718, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is good and the tutorial worked well for you. THe only problem I see is the use of selective desaturation is in my opinion supposed to provide a pop of color to act as the focal point, Here, the focal point is caused more by the compositional technique of filling the frame and the selective desat acts as secondary. At any rate it''s a good photo with lots of detail in the tomato.</td>', 'This is good and the tutorial worked well for you. THe only problem I see is the use of selective desaturation is in my opinion supposed to provide a pop of color to act as the focal point, Here, the focal point is caused more by the compositional technique of filling the frame and the selective desat acts as secondary. At any rate it''s a good photo with lots of detail in the tomato.', '2011-07-23 16:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
