(6480658, 962691, 67697, '<td valign="top">That is excellent!  How far back from the fence were you standing?  Usually I use my 70-300 to get the pitcher at the mound and get close to the fence so I am shooting thru a gap.  I have not been able to get good action shots like this at the plate from this perspective.</td>', 'That is excellent!  How far back from the fence were you standing?  Usually I use my 70-300 to get the pitcher at the mound and get close to the fence so I am shooting thru a gap.  I have not been able to get good action shots like this at the plate from this perspective.', '2011-07-25 09:17:51.000000', NULL, 0),
