(6509091, 962831, 54645, '<td valign="top">You asked for feedback and negative comments to help reconcile your score with the positive comments. I gave this a 5, based on the concept, mood, and intent that I saw you reaching for with the skull, color, and titile. Again, the composition is lacking a dynamic component to stimulate me and pull me in. It''s just there. Red. Staring. Don <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">posthumous</a> described it perfectly, and Brian <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=76335" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bvy</a>noted what I felt as well. <br/> <br/>Still life photography is very difficult in my opinion, practice the arrangement of objects to convey the emotion/story/etc. Practice with natural light and anything that will manipulate that light to enhance your end game. That is what this image is missing. <br/> <br/>A well earned brown, congrats! ;)</td>', 'You asked for feedback and negative comments to help reconcile your score with the positive comments. I gave this a 5, based on the concept, mood, and intent that I saw you reaching for with the skull, color, and titile. Again, the composition is lacking a dynamic component to stimulate me and pull me in. It''s just there. Red. Staring. Don  posthumous described it perfectly, and Brian  bvynoted what I felt as well.  Still life photography is very difficult in my opinion, practice the arrangement of objects to convey the emotion/story/etc. Practice with natural light and anything that will manipulate that light to enhance your end game. That is what this image is missing.  A well earned brown, congrats! ;)', '2011-08-19 04:13:55.000000', NULL, 0),
